# ✒ Metadata
#     - Title: Git Ignore Rules (MONOLITH Edition - v1.1)
#     - File Name: .gitignore
#     - Relative Path: .gitignore
#     - Artifact Type: config
#     - Version: 1.1.2
#     - Date: 10/24/2026
#     - Update: Saturday, October 24, 2026
#     - Author: Dennis 'dendogg' Smaltz
#     - A.I. Acknowledgement: Anthropic - Claude Opus 5.5
#     - Signature: ︻デ═─── ✦ ✦ ✦ | Aim Twice, Shoot Once!
#
# ✒ Changelog:
#     - 1.1.2 (10/24/2026) [dendogg + Anthropic - Claude Opus 5.5] — The
#       pillar models moved to assets/models/, as Dennis asked; the rule for
#       their .glb.json wrappers follows them.
#     - 1.1.1 (10/24/2026) [dendogg + Anthropic - Claude Opus 5.5] — Renamed
#       with the project: Wizard's Chess is now MONOLITH, the name Dennis
#       chose.
#     - 1.1.0 (10/23/2026) [dendogg + Anthropic - Claude Opus 5.5] — With
#       the calibration kit folded into the project, as Dennis chose, the
#       calibrator's results file is left out, and so is archive/, the
#       local keepsakes folder.
#     - 1.0.0 (10/23/2026) [dendogg + Anthropic - Claude Opus 5.5] — First
#       release, for the public repository Dennis asked to prepare: what
#       Git leaves out of version control.
#
# ✒ Description:
#     Files that are machine-specific, regenerated or disposable. The page
#     itself needs nothing here: every file it loads is tracked, including
#     the vendored engine (engine/) and the pillar models
#     (assets/models/*.glb).
#
# ✒ Other Important Information:
#     - assets/models/*.glb.json are the same bytes as each .glb, wrapped for a
#       host that serves no .glb (tools/pack-models.mjs writes them when
#       the page is published there). GitHub Pages and local servers serve
#       the .glb, so the wrappers are not kept.
#     - The .blend files in assets/models/ are Dennis's sources and stay tracked;
#       only Blender's numbered backups are left out.
#     - archive/ holds superseded material kept on Dennis's machine and not
#       published. calibration-kit-1.0.0/ is the kit of 10/14/2026 (the
#       1.3.0 page, calibrator 1.0.0 and its guides) without its engine,
#       which was a copy of engine/; tools/calibrate.js still measures
#       that page when --page points at it.
# ---------

# operating systems
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# editors (VS Code's folder holds per-machine Live Server settings)
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Node tools and their logs
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
*.log

# the level calibrator's results (tools/calibrate.js, CALIBRATION.md)
calibration.csv

# superseded material kept locally, never published (see above)
archive/

# models wrapped for hosts that serve no .glb (tools/pack-models.mjs)
assets/models/*.glb.json

# Blender's backups of the .blend sources
*.blend1
*.blend2

# local secrets, never committed
.env
.env.*
